  "notes": "An intensifying adjective stressing great scale or degree. Frequently written in hiragana (ものすごい). The adverbial {物凄|ものすご}く is extremely common as a casual intensifier meaning 'very'.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {物凄|ものすご}い{勢|いきお}い: tremendous momentum\n- {物凄|ものすご}く{暑|あつ}い: incredibly hot\n- {物凄|ものすご}い{数|かず}: a huge number\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- すごい: amazing; great — milder and more everyday; ものすごい is a stronger intensification",
